<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!-- KILTRO quadruped.

     Author: Lucas Garrido Sein
     Affiliation: LEMUR (Laboratory for Engineering in Mechatronics and Robotics), Universidad de Chile

     Units: metres, kilograms, radians. Trunk frame: X forward, Y left, Z up.
     Joint zero is the robot mid-stance pose, legs folded, not the straight-leg pose.

     Gearing: abduction and thigh 1:26.11 (two 1:5.11 planetary stages),
     knee 1:31.33 (same planetary plus a 30/36 tooth belt).
     
     Reflected rotor inertia is 0.03 kg m2 per joint. URDF has no field for it directly. -->
